  - harmonic-analysis
  - discrete-mathematics
abstract: >-
  HVE-720 is a deterministic bijective encoding architecture over the
  finite Abelian group G = Z_360 × Z_2 × Z_5 × Z_9 (cardinality 32,400).
  It provides mixed-radix state encoding, circular geometry on C_360,
  Fourier analysis on G, and a pointed chromatic extension (543 billion states).
